Store ignores it too:

    // openapi3/schema_pattern.go:16-37
    func (schema *Schema) compilePattern(c RegexCompilerFunc) (cp RegexMatcher, err error) {
        pattern := schema.Pattern
        if c != nil { cp, err = c(pattern) } else { cp, err = regexp.Compile(intoGoRegexp(pattern)) }
        ...
        compiledPatterns.Store(pattern, cp)   // same global map for both engines
    }

compiledPatterns is a package-level sync.Map (openapi3/schema.go:46) shared by every document and every caller in the process. The file already carries a note about racy behaviour around this cache (schema_pattern.go:15) but not about compiler identity.

