The chain is RequestError.Error() (openapi3filter/errors.go:23) -> err.Err.Error() -> SchemaError.Error(). ConvertErrors only rewrites a subset of error shapes (openapi3filter/validation_error_encoder.go:27-51); a MultiError, a SecurityRequirementsError, or any unrecognised cause falls through unchanged and is rendered in full. The struct's own doc comment states the opposite intent: "The message should never include the original value to prevent leakage of potentially sensitive inputs in error messages" (openapi3/schema.go:3110).

Guard present in one entry point:

