T.Validate only requires the field to be non-empty (openapi3/openapi3.go:277-281); there is no 'unsupported version' error. The consumers that then behave differently are openapi3filter/validate_request.go:247 and 359 and openapi3filter/validate_response.go:76, all gated on IsOpenAPI31OrLater().
